    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92136" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥακ-τήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάσσω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for striking with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέντρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					802
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλη βοῶν ἄναυλα καὶ ῥ</span>.
				<i>broken, discordant</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψοφώδη καὶ θορυβώδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				699
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥακτήριον: ὄρχησίς τις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥακτήρια: τύμπανα</span>, Id.</div>
